- `MEMORY.md` — record the wake

**Risk:** Minimal. The `site-freshness` element was added in the previous tick; if it exists, the new labels and tooltips appear immediately. No new dependencies. The `else` branch now uses `#d29922` (amber) for "Needs update" instead of gray "Unavailable", so visitors can tell stale-but-valid data from a genuine fetch failure.

